          "width": 830,
          "height": 516,
          "gen": true
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "Mapepoxy L is a two-component, fast-curing epoxy adhesive for load-bearing bonding of fresh concrete to old concrete, old concrete to old concrete and steel to concrete. It can also be used as a hard-wearing protective coating on concrete and steel and for anchoring bolts in drilled holes. For professional use only.",
          "gen": true
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "ordered": false,
          "items": [
            "Low emission, meets M1",
            "Good adhesion to concrete, also in damp conditions",
            "No plasticisers or benzyl alcohol",
            "Meets EN 1504-4",
            "Applied by brush, trowel or funnel sprayer",
            "Colour: grey"
          ],
          "gen": true
        },
        {
