          "text": "Areas of use",
          "gen": true
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "ordered": false,
          "items": [
            "Bonding fresh concrete to hardened concrete",
            "Bonding hardened concrete to hardened concrete",
            "Bonding steel to concrete or steel to steel (horizontal surfaces only)",
            "Anchoring bolts in drilled holes",
            "Protective coating on concrete and steel, at least 2 coats with a sand broadcast in between"
          ],
          "gen": true
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Application",
          "gen": true
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "ordered": false,
          "items": [
            "The concrete must be clean, dust-free and sound, preferably sandblasted. Steel must be free of rust (sandblasting to SA 2½)",
